WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:02.010
Well, how did you do today?

2
00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:06.640
May the God of hope
fill you with all…

3
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:12.420
and that's right. May the God of

4
00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:17.170
hope fill you with
all joy and peace.

5
00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:18.690
Let me pray for you.

6
00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.610
Lord, thank you for today.

7
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:25.090
Thank you for this opportunity,
Lord, to just come and be

8
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:26.590
refreshed.

9
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.830
To be rejuvenated,
Lord, to be replenished.

10
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:36.910
So we just take in your word
because we need it, God.

11
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:41.010
We need it so
desperately every day.

12
00:00:41.820 --> 00:00:46.570
Lord, and as we are
committing this scripture

13
00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:49.850
to our hearts, I pray that
it would be doing something

14
00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.350
supernatural

15
00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:58.230
inside of us. I pray it would
be shifting our perspective.

16
00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:03.220
I pray it would be challenging
some of our beliefs.

17
00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:07.540
Lord, I pray that it would
be a place that we could come

18
00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:12.660
like a harbor, God,
and we would find safety

19
00:01:12.710 --> 00:01:16.740
and comfort in your word
as we seek your presence.

20
00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:18.743
In Jesus' name, amen.

